#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:76
msgid "Witch's Monocle"
msgstr "Monocle de sorcière"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:76
msgid "Enchanted things glow when they sound, witchlight or not."
msgstr "Les objets enchantés luisent quand ils sonnent, lueur-sorcière ou pas."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:77
msgid "Witch's Draught"
msgstr "Philtre de sorcière"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:77
msgid "Enchanted things turn up three times as often."
msgstr "Les objets enchantés apparaissent trois fois plus souvent."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:78
msgid "Aether Jar"
msgstr "Bocal d'éther"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:78
msgid ""
"Each enchanted thing you find this run makes everything {0} likelier to be enchanted (up to {1})."
msgstr ""
"Chaque objet enchanté trouvé dans cette partie donne à tout objet {0} de chances en plus d'être enchanté (jusqu'à {1})."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:80
msgid "Enchanter's Chalk"
msgstr "Craie d'enchanteur"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:80
msgid ""
"An enchantment spreads: a chest with an enchanted thing in it has a second one."
msgstr ""
"L'enchantement se propage : un coffre qui contient un objet enchanté en contient un second."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:81
msgid "Spellbinder's Ring"
msgstr "Anneau d'envoûteur"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:81
msgid "Enchanted things are worth four times as much, not twice."
msgstr "Les objets enchantés valent le quadruple, et non le double."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:83
msgid "Lantern Moth"
msgstr "Phalène des lanternes"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:83
msgid ""
"Every enchanted thing in a chest is starred on your slip as the chest comes in, witchlight or not."
msgstr ""
"Chaque objet enchanté d'un coffre est marqué d'une étoile sur votre fiche dès que le coffre arrive, lueur-sorcière ou pas."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:85
msgid "Archmage's Staff"
msgstr "Bâton d'archimage"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:85
msgid "Everything in a chest with an enchanted thing in it is enchanted."
msgstr ""
"Tout ce que contient un coffre où se trouve un objet enchanté est enchanté."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:88
msgid "Sealed Bid"
msgstr "Pli cacheté"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:88
msgid "Buy a chest sight unseen and its seller knocks {0} off."
msgstr ""
"Achetez un coffre les yeux fermés : son vendeur vous fait {0} de remise."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:90
msgid "Lucky Dip"
msgstr "Pochette-surprise"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:90
msgid ""
"Everything in a chest you take sight unseen is {0} likelier to come out a step better."
msgstr ""
"Tout ce que contient un coffre acheté les yeux fermés a {0} de chances en plus de sortir un cran au-dessus."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:91
msgid "Underwriter's Bond"
msgstr "Caution d'assureur"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:91
msgid ""
"A chest bought sight unseen holds less than you paid? The Underwriters pay {0} of it back."
msgstr ""
"Un coffre acheté les yeux fermés vaut moins que son prix ? Les assureurs vous remboursent {0} de l'écart."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:93
msgid "Wholesaler's Tally"
msgstr "Ardoise du grossiste"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:93
msgid ""
"Each chest you buy makes every seller after it today ask {0} less (up to {1})."
msgstr ""
"Chaque coffre acheté fait baisser de {0} le prix de tous les vendeurs suivants du jour (jusqu'à {1})."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:95
msgid "Gambler's Token"
msgstr "Jeton de joueur"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:95
msgid "Twice as many surprises in everything you open: good ones and bad ones."
msgstr ""
"Deux fois plus de surprises dans tout ce que vous ouvrez : des bonnes comme des mauvaises."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:96
msgid "Fortune's Blindfold"
msgstr "Bandeau de Fortune"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:96
msgid ""
"Sight unseen, a chest costs {0} less, and nothing in it comes out worse than promised."
msgstr ""
"Acheté les yeux fermés, un coffre coûte {0} de moins, et rien dedans ne sort moins bien que promis."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:100
msgid "Merchant's Signet"
msgstr "Chevalière de marchand"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:100
msgid ""
"Hagglers hear you out (an offer too low gets a second try), and come down {0} further."
msgstr ""
"Les marchandeurs vous écoutent (une offre trop basse a droit à un second essai) et baissent encore de {0}."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:102
msgid "Silver Tongue"
msgstr "Langue d'argent"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:102
msgid ""
"Hagglers come down a fifth further, and those who wait for an offer take a fifth less."
msgstr ""
"Les marchandeurs baissent encore d'un cinquième ; ceux qui attendent une offre prennent un cinquième de moins."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:103
msgid "Haggler's Knot"
msgstr "Nœud du marchandeur"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:103
msgid ""
"Each chest you talk down this run makes every seller ask {0} less (up to {1})."
msgstr ""
"Chaque coffre marchandé dans cette partie fait baisser de {0} le prix de tous les vendeurs (jusqu'à {1})."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:105
msgid "Waiting Game"
msgstr "L'art d'attendre"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:105
msgid ""
"Every chest you pass makes the next seller ask {0} less (up to {1}). Buying starts it again."
msgstr ""
"Chaque coffre passé fait baisser de {0} le prix du vendeur suivant (jusqu'à {1}). Un achat remet tout à zéro."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:107
msgid "Closing Bell"
msgstr "Cloche du soir"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:107
msgid "The last customer of the day asks {0} less."
msgstr "Le dernier client de la journée demande {0} de moins."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:109
msgid "Factor's Abacus"
msgstr "Abaque de courtier"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:109
msgid ""
"You know the least a haggler will take: your offer starts on it, and they take it."
msgstr ""
"Vous savez le minimum qu'un marchandeur acceptera : votre offre part de là, et il l'accepte."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:110
msgid "Haggler's Purse"
msgstr "Bourse du marchandeur"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:110
msgid ""
"Everyone but Old Aldo and the Maw haggles with you, and {0} of whatever you talk them down by comes back to you as well."
msgstr ""
"Tout le monde, sauf le vieil Aldo et la Gueule, marchande avec vous, et {0} de chaque rabais obtenu vous revient en plus."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:112
msgid "Golden Tongue"
msgstr "Langue d'or"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:112
msgid ""
"All but Old Aldo and the Maw haggle and never walk out: go as low as you like, and they come down to {0} under their least."
msgstr ""
"Sauf le vieil Aldo et la Gueule, tous marchandent sans partir : même très bas, ils descendent à {0} sous leur minimum."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:116
msgid "Ear Trumpet"
msgstr "Cornet acoustique"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:116
msgid "Nothing drowns out or muffles a sound for you: no clank, and no straw."
msgstr ""
"Rien ne couvre ni n'étouffe les sons pour vous : ni les clangs, ni la paille."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:117
msgid "Pocket Watch"
msgstr "Montre de gousset"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:117
msgid ""
"Impatient sellers give you twice as long, and a rotten chest stands twice the shaking."
msgstr ""
"Les vendeurs pressés vous laissent deux fois plus de temps, et un coffre pourri supporte deux fois plus de secousses."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:118
msgid "Counting Beads"
msgstr "Boulier"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:118
msgid ""
"A chest its seller says nothing else about comes with a tally of every thing in it, false bottom and all."
msgstr ""
"Un coffre dont le vendeur ne dit rien d'autre arrive avec le décompte de tout ce qu'il contient, double fond compris."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:119
msgid "Appraiser's Seal"
msgstr "Cachet d'expert"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:119
msgid "A perfect read pays you a valuer's fee: {0} of what the chest held."
msgstr ""
"Une lecture parfaite vous rapporte des honoraires d'expert : {0} de la valeur du contenu."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:121
msgid "Scrivener's Quill"
msgstr "Plume de greffier"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:121
msgid ""
"Your slip ticks each thing as you hear it, and counts them. What you work out is still yours to mark."
msgstr ""
"Votre fiche coche chaque objet à mesure que vous l'entendez, et les compte. Ce que vous déduisez reste à marquer vous-même."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:123
msgid "Valuer's Register"
msgstr "Registre du priseur"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:123
msgid ""
"A perfect read pays {0} of what the chest held for each one so far this run (up to {1})."
msgstr ""
"Une lecture parfaite rapporte {0} de la valeur du contenu par lecture parfaite de la partie (jusqu'à {1})."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:125
msgid "Cursed Crescent"
msgstr "Croissant maudit"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:125
msgid ""
"Everything comes out exactly as its chest promised. Sellers sense the curse and ask {0} less."
msgstr ""
"Tout sort pile comme son coffre le promet. Les vendeurs sentent la malédiction et demandent {0} de moins."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:127
msgid "Tuning Fork"
msgstr "Diapason"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:127
msgid ""
"Each perfect read in a row: the next chest's things sell for {0} more (up to {1})."
msgstr ""
"Pour chaque lecture parfaite d'affilée, les objets du coffre suivant se vendent {0} plus cher (jusqu'à {1})."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:129
msgid "Ledger of Certainty"
msgstr "Livre des certitudes"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:129
msgid ""
"A perfect read: everything in the chest sells for {0} more. A wrong slip: {1} less."
msgstr ""
"Lecture parfaite : tout le contenu du coffre se vend {0} plus cher. Fiche erronée : {1} moins cher."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:131
msgid "Truthglass"
msgstr "Verre de vérité"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:131
msgid "A perfect read: everything in the chest sells for half as much again."
msgstr "Lecture parfaite : tout le contenu du coffre se vend moitié plus cher."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:133
msgid "Pocket Engine"
msgstr "Machine de poche"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:133
msgid ""
"Every chest is read for you: what's truly in it is on your slip as it comes in, false bottom and warded thing and all."
msgstr ""
"Chaque coffre est lu pour vous : son vrai contenu est sur votre fiche dès qu'il arrive, double fond et objet scellé compris."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:137
msgid "Padded Crate"
msgstr "Caisse rembourrée"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:137
msgid "Glass never breaks when you drop a chest."
msgstr "Le verre ne casse jamais quand vous laissez tomber un coffre."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:138
msgid "Smuggler's Hook"
msgstr "Grappin de contrebandier"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:138
msgid "Smugglers come your way: false bottoms turn up twice as often."
msgstr ""
"Les contrebandiers viennent à vous : les doubles fonds apparaissent deux fois plus souvent."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:139
msgid "Hollow Rod"
msgstr "Tige creuse"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:139
msgid ""
"What's under a false bottom comes out a step better: people hid their best."
msgstr ""
"Ce qui se cache sous un double fond sort un cran au-dessus : on y cachait ce qu'on avait de mieux."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:140
msgid "Smuggler's Log"
msgstr "Journal de contrebandier"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:140
msgid ""
"Smugglers trust a buyer who keeps quiet: each false bottom you open this run makes false bottoms {0} likelier (up to {1})."
msgstr ""
"Chaque double fond ouvert dans la partie rend les doubles fonds {0} plus probables (jusqu'à {1})."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:143
msgid "Toll-man's Gauge"
msgstr "Jauge de péager"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:143
msgid ""
"A false bottom is marked on your slip as the chest comes in: no drop needed."
msgstr ""
"Un double fond est marqué sur votre fiche dès que le coffre arrive : inutile de le laisser tomber."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:144
msgid "Black Market Pass"
msgstr "Sésame du marché noir"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:144
msgid ""
"Thornwick's black market pays double for anything from under a false bottom."
msgstr ""
"Le marché noir de Thornwick paie le double pour tout ce qui sort d'un double fond."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:145
msgid "Smugglers' Compass"
msgstr "Boussole des contrebandiers"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:145
msgid "Every chest has a false bottom."
msgstr "Tous les coffres ont un double fond."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:148
msgid "Warden's Lantern"
msgstr "Lanterne de Gardien"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:148
msgid ""
"Every sign a seller leaves (a dream, a tag, a riddle, a card...) points at a warded thing."
msgstr ""
"Chaque signe laissé par un vendeur (un rêve, une étiquette, une énigme, une carte...) désigne un objet scellé."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:150
msgid "Sleeper's Pillow"
msgstr "Oreiller du dormeur"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:150
msgid ""
"Sellers dream true for you: {0} of those with nothing else to tell you have warded something, and tell you their dream."
msgstr ""
"Rêves vrais : {0} des vendeurs qui n'ont rien d'autre à dire ont scellé un objet, et vous racontent leur rêve."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:152
msgid "Wardbreaker's Tally"
msgstr "Ardoise du brise-sceau"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:152
msgid ""
"Each warded thing you name this run makes warded things sell for {0} more."
msgstr ""
"Chaque objet scellé que vous nommez dans cette partie fait vendre les objets scellés {0} plus cher."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:153
msgid "Ward-Key"
msgstr "Clé des sceaux"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:153
msgid "A warded thing you name comes out a step better."
msgstr "Un objet scellé que vous nommez sort un cran au-dessus."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:155
msgid "Wardens' Primer"
msgstr "Abécédaire des Gardiens"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:155
msgid "When a sign points at a warded thing, your slip names it for you."
msgstr ""
"Quand un signe désigne un objet scellé, votre fiche le nomme pour vous."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:156
msgid "The Aldric Seal"
msgstr "Le Sceau d'Aldric"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:156
msgid ""
"Every seller with nothing else to tell you has warded a thing in their chest, and tells you a sign for it."
msgstr ""
"Tout vendeur qui n'a rien d'autre à vous dire a scellé un objet dans son coffre, et vous en donne un signe."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:159
msgid "Lucky Shell"
msgstr "Coquillage porte-bonheur"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:159
msgid ""
"A dry spell ends twice as soon: luck starts to turn after {0} plain finds, not {1}."
msgstr ""
"Une mauvaise passe dure moitié moins : la chance tourne après {0} trouvailles ordinaires, et non {1}."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:161
msgid "Lucky Coin"
msgstr "Sou porte-bonheur"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:161
msgid ""
"The first chest you buy each day: each thing in it rolls its quality twice and keeps the better roll."
msgstr ""
"Le premier coffre acheté chaque jour : chaque objet qu'il contient tire sa qualité deux fois et garde le meilleur tirage."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:162
msgid "Rabbit's Foot"
msgstr "Patte de lapin"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:162
msgid ""
"Everything you open is {0} likelier to come out a step better than its chest."
msgstr ""
"Tout ce que vous ouvrez a {0} de chances en plus de sortir un cran au-dessus de son coffre."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:163
msgid "Wishbone"
msgstr "Os à vœux"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:163
msgid ""
"Something that comes out better than its chest sells for half as much again."
msgstr "Un objet qui sort meilleur que son coffre se vend moitié plus cher."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:164
msgid "Horseshoe"
msgstr "Fer à cheval"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:164
msgid ""
"Each chest in a row with a surprise makes the next one's things {0} likelier to come out a step better (up to {1})."
msgstr ""
"Chaque coffre à surprise d'affilée : +{0} de chances d'un cran au-dessus pour les objets du suivant (max {1})."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:166
msgid "Four-Leaf Clover"
msgstr "Trèfle à quatre feuilles"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:166
msgid ""
"The first chest you buy each week: everything in it comes out a step better."
msgstr ""
"Le premier coffre acheté chaque semaine : tout ce qu'il contient sort un cran au-dessus."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:167
msgid "Shooting Star"
msgstr "Étoile filante"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:167
msgid ""
"Once a day, the first thing to come out better than its chest climbs a step further (a purple thing shines)."
msgstr ""
"Une fois par jour, le premier objet qui sort meilleur que son coffre monte encore d'un cran (un objet violet se met à briller)."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:168
msgid "Fate's Spindle"
msgstr "Fuseau du destin"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:168
msgid ""
"Each surprise this run makes everything {0} likelier to come out a step better (up to {1})."
msgstr ""
"Chaque surprise de la partie : tout objet a {0} de chances en plus de sortir un cran au-dessus (jusqu'à {1})."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:172
msgid "Shop Lantern"
msgstr "Lanterne d'échoppe"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:172
msgid "Open late: one more customer every day."
msgstr "Ouvert tard : un client de plus chaque jour."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:173
msgid "Queue Ticket"
msgstr "Ticket d'attente"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:173
msgid ""
"The first chest you pass each day comes back at the end of the day, asking {0} less."
msgstr ""
"Le premier coffre passé chaque jour revient en fin de journée, {0} moins cher."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:175
msgid "Barker's Horn"
msgstr "Corne de bonimenteur"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:175
msgid "Two more customers every day, but word's out: everyone asks {0} more."
msgstr ""
"Deux clients de plus chaque jour, mais la nouvelle s'est répandue : tout le monde demande {0} de plus."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:176
msgid "Guest Book"
msgstr "Registre des hôtes"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:176
msgid ""
"The day's first customer is the better sort: their chest is a colour finer (as far as purple)."
msgstr ""
"Le premier client du jour est de meilleure condition : son coffre est d'une couleur au-dessus (jusqu'au violet)."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:179
msgid "Collector's Catalogue"
msgstr "Catalogue raisonné"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:179
msgid "Every new kind of find this run pays {0}g (more in a grander shop)."
msgstr ""
"Chaque trouvaille inédite de cette partie rapporte {0} po (davantage dans une boutique plus cossue)."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:180
msgid "Bell Jar"
msgstr "Globe de verre"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:180 scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:48 scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:57
#: scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:60 scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:67 scripts/Core/Upgrades.cs:69
msgid "Room to display one more thing."
msgstr "De la place pour exposer un objet de plus."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:181
msgid "Visitors' Book"
msgstr "Livre d'or"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:181
msgid ""
"Every night, visitors leave {0}g per exhibition point (more in a grander shop)."
msgstr ""
"Chaque soir, les visiteurs laissent {0} po par point d'exposition (davantage dans une boutique plus cossue)."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:183
msgid "Velvet Rope"
msgstr "Cordon de velours"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:183
msgid "Your exhibition counts double."
msgstr "Votre exposition compte double."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:184
msgid "Gallery Lamps"
msgstr "Lampes de galerie"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:184
msgid "Everything sells for {0} more per exhibition point (up to {1})."
msgstr "Tout se vend {0} plus cher par point d'exposition (jusqu'à {1})."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:188
msgid "Smith's Glove"
msgstr "Gant de forgeron"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:188
msgid ""
"You mend weapons: never worse than their chest promised, and {0} likelier to come out better."
msgstr ""
"Vous réparez les armes : jamais moins bien que promis, et {0} de chances en plus de sortir meilleures."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:190
msgid "Hatter's Cap"
msgstr "Bonnet de feutre"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:190
msgid ""
"You mend cloaks: never worse than their chest promised, and {0} likelier to come out better."
msgstr ""
"Vous raccommodez les capes : jamais moins bien que promis, et {0} de chances en plus de sortir meilleures."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:192
msgid "Whetstone"
msgstr "Pierre à aiguiser"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:192
msgid "Weapons sell for three-quarters more."
msgstr "Les armes se vendent trois quarts plus cher."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:193
msgid "Tailor's Dummy"
msgstr "Mannequin de tailleur"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:193
msgid ""
"Cloaks sell for half as much again, and count {0} times over on display."
msgstr ""
"Les capes se vendent moitié plus cher, et comptent {0} fois plus en vitrine."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:194
msgid "Moneychanger's Scales"
msgstr "Balance de changeur"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:194
msgid "Coin sells for a fifth more for every purse of it in the chest."
msgstr ""
"Les pièces se vendent un cinquième plus cher pour chaque bourse que contient le coffre."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:195
msgid "Alchemist's Still"
msgstr "Alambic d'alchimiste"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:195
msgid ""
"Potions sell for half as much again, and broken glass still sells for half."
msgstr ""
"Les potions se vendent moitié plus cher, et le verre brisé se vend encore à moitié prix."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:196
msgid "Scribe's Desk"
msgstr "Pupitre de scribe"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:196
msgid ""
"Spells sell for half as much again, and sand sells as ink, for a third of a spell."
msgstr ""
"Les sorts se vendent moitié plus cher, et le sable se vend pour sécher l'encre, au tiers du prix d'un sort."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:197
msgid "Gem Cutter's Wheel"
msgstr "Meule de lapidaire"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:197
msgid "Gems are {0} likelier to come out a step better."
msgstr "Les gemmes ont {0} de chances en plus de sortir un cran au-dessus."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:200
msgid "Locksmith's Oil"
msgstr "Huile de serrurier"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:200
msgid "Every lock has one pin fewer."
msgstr "Chaque serrure a une goupille de moins."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:201
msgid "Burglar's Knife"
msgstr "Couteau de cambrioleur"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:201
msgid "Forcing a lock breaks nothing and scratches nothing."
msgstr "Forcer une serrure ne casse rien et ne raye rien."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:202
msgid "Kid Gloves"
msgstr "Gants de chevreau"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:202
msgid "Nobody minds a hard shake, a drop or the lodestone on their chest."
msgstr ""
"Personne ne s'offusque d'une secousse forte, d'une chute ou de la pierre d'aimant sur son coffre."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:205
msgid "Jeweller's Loupe"
msgstr "Loupe de joaillier"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:205
msgid ""
"Paste gems and demon gold sell as costume pieces: a quarter of the real thing."
msgstr ""
"Les gemmes en toc et l'or démoniaque se vendent comme bijoux fantaisie : au quart du prix des vrais."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:206
msgid "Fence's Mark"
msgstr "Poinçon du receleur"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:206
msgid ""
"Crooks come by more often, and the Maw's buyers pay for any fake what the real thing fetches."
msgstr ""
"Les escrocs passent plus souvent, et les acheteurs de la Gueule paient tout faux au prix du vrai."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:210
msgid "Rainy-Day Purse"
msgstr "Bourse de secours"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:210
msgid "Bram's stash helps you out three times a run, not twice."
msgstr "La cagnotte de Bram vous dépanne trois fois par partie, et non deux."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:211
msgid "Pawn Ticket"
msgstr "Ticket de gage"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:211
msgid ""
"On a short night, what you pawn fetches four-fifths of its price, not three-fifths."
msgstr ""
"Une nuit de la Guilde où l'or manque, vos gages rapportent les quatre cinquièmes de leur prix, et non trois."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:212
msgid "Guildsman's Marker"
msgstr "Insigne de la Guilde"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:212
msgid "Bram's word is good twice a run, not once."
msgstr "La parole de Bram vaut deux fois par partie, et non une."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:213
msgid "Savings Jar"
msgstr "Tirelire"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:213
msgid ""
"Every night: {0} of your gold as interest (up to {1}g at the stall, more in a grander shop)."
msgstr ""
"Chaque soir : {0} de votre or en intérêts (jusqu'à {1} po à l'étal, davantage dans une boutique plus cossue)."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:215
msgid "Miser's Lockbox"
msgstr "Cassette de l'avare"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:215
msgid ""
"Every Guild night, once you've paid, your purse grows by {0} of what's left in it."
msgstr ""
"Chaque nuit de la Guilde, une fois la dîme payée, votre bourse grossit de {0} de ce qui lui reste."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:217
msgid "Guild Promissory Note"
msgstr "Billet à ordre de la Guilde"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:217
msgid ""
"The Guild's own paper: once a run, on a Guild night you can't cover, it pays what's short (not the last week)."
msgstr ""
"Une fois par partie, une nuit où l'or manque, il paie le reste (sauf la dernière semaine)."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:220
msgid "Letter of Introduction"
msgstr "Lettre de recommandation"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:220
msgid "Regulars take what you deliver a quality lower than they asked for."
msgstr ""
"Les habitués acceptent une livraison d'une qualité en dessous de leur demande."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:221
msgid "Patron's Ribbon"
msgstr "Ruban du mécène"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:221
msgid "Commissions pay half as much again."
msgstr "Les commandes rapportent moitié plus."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:222
msgid "Errand Book"
msgstr "Carnet de commandes"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:222
msgid "The regulars post {0} more commissions every week."
msgstr "Les habitués passent {0} commandes de plus chaque semaine."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:224
msgid "Songcatcher's Net"
msgstr "Filet à chants"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:224
msgid "Heartsongs are three times as likely to be in a chest."
msgstr ""
"Les Chants du cœur ont trois fois plus de chances de se trouver dans un coffre."

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:276
msgid "surprises (things better than their chest)"
msgstr "surprises (objets meilleurs que leur coffre)"

#: scripts/Core/Curios.cs:277
